      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market Apt.1, 80 Reuben Street, Rialto. This superb two-bedroom apartment is presented in turn-key condition and offers bright accommodation in an excellent location.\r\nReuben Street is ideally positioned close to an excellent selection of local amenities, cafés, shops and recreational facilities, while Dublin city centre is easily accessible. The area is also well served by public transport, providing convenient access to the city and surrounding areas.\r\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by an inviting hallway, with the accommodation conveniently laid out off the corridor. To the left is the impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area which creates a wonderful modern space for both everyday living and entertaining. The contemporary kitchen offers excellent functionality and flows seamlessly into the dining and living areas, with direct \r\nAlong the right hand side of the hallway are two well-proportioned bedrooms. The master bedroom benefits from a private en-suite, while both bedrooms feature fitted wardrobes. A modern family bathroom is located at the end of the hallway.\r\nThe property is finished to a high standard throughout and would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, s or investors. The combination of a turn-key finish, generous living accommodation and private outdoor space makes this an attractive apartment in a highly sought-after Dublin 8 location.\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is available by appointment only through David Ross Estate Agents.\r\nKey Features\r\nTwo-bedroom apartment\r\nTurn-key finish\r\nBright entrance hallway\r\nOpen-plan living/dining/kitchen\r\nModern kitchen\r\nMaster bedroom with en-suite\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nFamily bathroom\r\nSunny private balcony\r\nExcellent Dublin 8 location\r\nConvenient access to Dublin city centre\r\nManagment fee: 2,000 per annum"
      },
